<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-058" chapter-id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu" source-id="s-songshu-058-ws1996691-wangqiu">
  <p id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p001:m0000" ref="3c9_d1d_870_B">王球</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p001:m0003" ref="3c9_d1d_870_B">倩玉</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，太常<persName id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAEEB">惠</persName>從父弟也。父<persName id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p001:m0021" ref="3c9_d1d_870">謐</persName>，司徒。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">唯<persName id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p002:m0001" ref="3c9_d1d_870_B">球</persName>輒去，未嘗肯停。十八年，卒，時年四十九。追贈特進、金紫光祿大夫，加散騎常侍。無子，從孫<rs id="c-songshu-058-wangqiu:p002:m0045" type="unresolved">奐</rs>為後。</p>
</text>
